WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:17.690
(suspenseful music)

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:18.820
- [Voiceover] So a few years ago,

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:20.320
my girlfriend and I, we decided to go

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.690
see a movie downtown.

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:23.110
And for some idiotic reason,

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:26.352
we decided to buy one of
those giant buckets of popcorn

00:00:26.352 --> 00:00:28.910
and I actually ended up
eating most if not all of it

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:30.450
before the movie had even started.

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:32.660
So, stupid decision,
and I guess you can say

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:34.830
that's where the read drama begins.

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:36.560
After the movie ends,
we're walking to the car,

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:40.090
and I just feel sick, but
I'm able to fight that off

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:42.260
with thinking, you know, it's
25 minutes until we get home,

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:44.490
it's not really going to be a problem.

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:46.422
So we get into the car, and we're driving,

00:00:46.422 --> 00:00:48.052
and all of a sudden the popcorn in my body

00:00:48.052 --> 00:00:51.472
just decides to change direction
towards the poop realm.

00:00:51.472 --> 00:00:53.182
And I'm not going to share
this with my girlfriend,

00:00:53.182 --> 00:00:54.582
so I just keep it to myself.

00:00:54.582 --> 00:00:56.532
My body is just rigid with tension

00:00:56.532 --> 00:00:58.412
trying to just hold this in.

00:00:58.412 --> 00:01:00.305
So we're driving, and we just run into

00:01:00.305 --> 00:01:02.562
a giant wall of bumper to bumper traffic,

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:04.802
and I think oh my God, this is the end.

00:01:04.802 --> 00:01:07.452
My girlfriend can clearly
sense that something is wrong,

00:01:07.452 --> 00:01:10.622
so she looks over at me,
and calmly but blatantly

00:01:10.622 --> 00:01:12.832
just goes, "Do you have to poop?"

00:01:12.832 --> 00:01:15.702
And our relationship wasn't
necessarily at poop status yet,

00:01:15.702 --> 00:01:17.262
but I just kind of looked straight forward

00:01:17.262 --> 00:01:19.162
and just said, "Yep."

00:01:19.162 --> 00:01:20.882
We think, OK, you know
what, our best option

00:01:20.882 --> 00:01:22.922
is probably to take the
next exit whatever it is.

00:01:22.922 --> 00:01:24.712
However the next exit that was coming up

00:01:24.712 --> 00:01:26.262
was just a really bad neighborhood.

00:01:26.262 --> 00:01:28.722
We decided, you know what,
that's what has to happen.

00:01:28.722 --> 00:01:31.802
So we get off the exit, and
I'm driving like Jason Bourne.

00:01:31.802 --> 00:01:33.798
I'm just weaving in and out of traffic,

00:01:33.798 --> 00:01:36.505
and we make a turn, and I
can see there's a (beep)

00:01:36.505 --> 00:01:38.982
in the distance, and I
think, oh my God, salvation.

00:01:38.982 --> 00:01:41.225
But then this really fast thought process

00:01:41.225 --> 00:01:42.812
just rockets through my head,

00:01:42.812 --> 00:01:44.932
and I think, no, this can't be an option

00:01:44.932 --> 00:01:46.142
because if you go in there,

00:01:46.142 --> 00:01:47.572
and there's someone in the bathroom,

00:01:47.572 --> 00:01:48.532
or they're cleaning it, or it's locked,

00:01:48.532 --> 00:01:51.692
or whatever the reason,
you're gonna poop your pants

00:01:51.692 --> 00:01:54.282
in front of 30 plus people,
in a bad neighborhood.

00:01:54.282 --> 00:01:57.252
So all of those kind of
mark off the checklist,

00:01:57.252 --> 00:01:59.242
this isn't going to
work, and I just decide,

00:01:59.242 --> 00:02:00.622
you know what, game time decision.

00:02:00.622 --> 00:02:02.962
Let's drive my car over the sidewalk

00:02:02.962 --> 00:02:05.672
and just behind this
abandoned factory building.

00:02:05.672 --> 00:02:08.502
I scamper out of this
car like a wild animal,

00:02:08.502 --> 00:02:11.342
I run behind a dumpster, and
I just shit my brains out.

00:02:11.342 --> 00:02:14.902
I've never felt lower as a
human being in my entire life.

00:02:14.902 --> 00:02:18.132
But the next step now is
how do I clean myself up?

00:02:18.132 --> 00:02:21.562
So I ditch the underwear,
use that as toilet paper,

00:02:21.562 --> 00:02:23.682
and I'm looking around
for what else I can use

00:02:23.682 --> 00:02:26.322
and think, no, you're
behind an abandoned factory,

00:02:26.322 --> 00:02:28.782
you'll need a Tetanus
shot in your asshole.

00:02:28.782 --> 00:02:30.362
So that's not gonna be an option.

00:02:30.362 --> 00:02:33.105
So I pull my pants up, I kind
of waddle back to the car.

00:02:33.105 --> 00:02:36.202
My girlfriend is hysterically
laughing this entire time.

00:02:36.202 --> 00:02:38.492
And I'd cleaned out my car the day before,

00:02:38.492 --> 00:02:40.242
so there was nothing I could use.

00:02:40.242 --> 00:02:42.542
Napkins, paper towels, nothing.

00:02:42.542 --> 00:02:44.792
But there were Google map directions,

00:02:44.792 --> 00:02:47.342
so I decided to use those,
go back behind the dumpster,

00:02:47.342 --> 00:02:50.422
clean myself up as best
as I can to that point,

00:02:50.422 --> 00:02:53.012
get back into the car,
I'm smelling terrible,

00:02:53.012 --> 00:02:55.682
continue our drive home,
eventually we make it home.

00:02:55.682 --> 00:02:58.812
I take a shower, I'm back to
a full human being status,

00:02:58.812 --> 00:03:01.022
and for the rest of that
day and into the night,

00:03:01.022 --> 00:03:02.892
this thought process that just

00:03:02.892 --> 00:03:04.892
kind of lodged itself in my brain was,

00:03:04.892 --> 00:03:07.422
what if someone goes behind that dumpster,

00:03:07.422 --> 00:03:10.712
and they see this mess of
just human poop everywhere,

00:03:10.712 --> 00:03:13.352
and they think, "Oh my god, who did this?

00:03:13.352 --> 00:03:16.532
What kind of disgusting monster
is responsible for this?"

00:03:16.532 --> 00:03:18.902
And then his partner, I guess,
picks up a piece of paper

00:03:18.902 --> 00:03:21.332
and says "Here's his
Google map directions.

00:03:21.332 --> 00:03:22.872
His address is right here.

00:03:22.872 --> 00:03:24.542
Let's go get him."

00:03:24.542 --> 00:03:26.172
And that doesn't make any sense,

00:03:26.172 --> 00:03:29.362
but that's what I had in my head.

00:03:29.362 --> 00:03:31.512
Needless to say, I was never held

00:03:31.512 --> 00:03:34.792
accountable for my
actions, so that is good.

00:03:34.792 --> 00:03:36.632
And I'm proud to say that the brave lady

00:03:36.632 --> 00:03:38.795
in that story is still
my girlfriend today.

00:03:38.795 --> 00:03:42.142
I would say that poop
brought us closer together.

00:03:42.142 --> 00:03:45.812
(suspenseful music)

